  <Groups>
    <Group elementId="CPLX-1905" textLabel="CPLX-1905" type="Complex">
      <Xref identifier="CPLX-1905" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="215" width="140" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>Chloroplast omega-3 desaturase desaturates 16:2 and 18:2 fatty acids to 16:3 and 18:3 on all 16:2- or 18:2-containing chloroplast membrane lipids including phosphatidylglycerol, monogalactosyldiacylglycerol, digalactosyldiaclyglycerol, and sulfoguinovosyldiacylglycerol. However, the further desaturated products of phosphatidylglycerol are minor composites of the chloroplast membrane lipid pool.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CPLX-1905" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="chloroplastic &amp;omega;-3 desaturase" />
      <Property key="ComplexComponents" value="AT3G11170-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="ComponentCount" value="1" />
      <Property key="IsComplex" value="true" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-23307, RXN-15275, RXN-13178, RXN-13179, RXN-13182, RXN-13181, RXN-13180, RXN-13184, RXN-13183, RXN-13195, RXN-13198, RXN-13197, RXN-13199, RXN-13261, RXN-13262, RXN-13263, RXN-13264, RXN-13266, RXN-13265, RXN-13215, RXN-2245" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="21" />
