      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="295" width="140" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>ER linoleate desaturase introduces a third double bond (delta-15) in linolenate in linolenate-containing phosphatidylcholine, an important extra-plastidial membrane lipid.</Comment>
